    "group": "Kill Rig",
    "summary": "A psychic level 1 ability. During a Fight phase, once this unit has been selected to fight while free of battle-shock, you may make a psychic roll of one D6 for it. If you do, a 1 battle-shocks this unit, and either way its melee attacks gain [LETHAL HITS] and [PSYCHIC]. The card does not say how long these weapon abilities last.",
